    "reviews": "\u201cWhomever named this AVN did it a great disservice. It sounds like a corny amateurish production when in fact the graphic quality and attention to detail of the images is among the best I've seen. The story is gripping and a bit dark. The main character is sort of a mix of The Punisher and James Bond with a backstory like the Punisher. The only complaint I have is the amount of clicking as you go from image to image during lewd scenes before animation kicks in. Otherwise this is a first rate AVN worth playing.\u201d<br>Steam<br><br>\u201ci give this visual novel a big thumbs up, the story is very enjoyable and makes you want to keep reading until the end. the renders are beautiful. the girls are also very beautiful to look at. the animations could be a bit better but they are certainly not bad. i hope for a new season soon. thanks to the dev's keep it up :heart174:\u201d<br>Steam<br><br>\u201cAgent Horny is a lewd kinetic novel where you basically play as an American James Bond. The story is short but it has some really well made scenes throughout, and nothing is missable because you can always choose to play the other scenes as well, when there is a choice. At several points you can choose an outfit for one of the females to wear during the next scene.  There is a bit of replayability in finding the hidden gallery images, but other than that it is a straight story. The various settings keep it interesting, though.\u201d<br>Steam<br>",
